/T (The live stack now deployed reflects this design. SENTRIX operates as the interface layer, SAGE as the analysis core, AXION as the executive output layer, ATLAS as the mapping system, BLACK DOG as the risk and restricted review layer, ORION as the monitoring layer, and WHITE WING as the battlespace tracking layer. Taken together, these systems move the network beyond one-off content into a true internal architecture.)
/E (The live stack now deployed reflects this design. SENTRIX operates as the interface layer, SAGE as the analysis core, AXION as the executive output layer, ATLAS as the mapping system, BLACK DOG as the risk and restricted review layer, ORION as the monitoring layer, and WHITE WING as the battlespace tracking layer. Taken together, these systems move the network beyond one-off content into a true internal architecture.)
