/P 107 0 R
/T (The RSR Intelligence Network is no longer a concept stack. It is now a live system environment with an actual interface layer, analysis layer, output layer, mapping layer, risk layer, monitoring layer, and tracking layer. That makes discipline more important, not less. The job now is to keep the architecture coherent as it grows, preserve the verification standards that protect trust, and continue building connective tissue between systems without turning the interface into noise.)
/E (The RSR Intelligence Network is no longer a concept stack. It is now a live system environment with an actual interface layer, analysis layer, output layer, mapping layer, risk layer, monitoring layer, and tracking layer. That makes discipline more important, not less. The job now is to keep the architecture coherent as it grows, preserve the verification standards that protect trust, and continue building connective tissue between systems without turning the interface into noise.)
