711 0 obj
<<
/Title (The RSR Intelligence Network exists to function as a controlled analysis environment rather than a reactive media brand. Its purpose is to intake raw information, determine what type of material has entered the system, process it through the correct reasoning and risk layers, and turn it into structured, decision-useful output. This means the network is built to reduce noise, expose uncertainty, and make signal more usable before it reaches publication or action. This means the network is built to reduce noise, expose uncertainty, and make signal more usable before it reaches publication or action.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 658 0 R
/Prev 688 0 R
/Next 712 0 R
>>
endobj
712 0 obj
<<
/Title (The live stack now deployed reflects this design. SENTRIX operates as the interface layer, SAGE as the analysis core, AXION as the executive output layer, ATLAS as the mapping system, BLACK DOG as the risk and restricted review layer, ORION as the monitoring layer, and WHITE WING as the battlespace tracking layer. Taken together, these systems move the network beyond one-off content into a true internal architecture.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 658 0 R
/Prev 711 0 R
/Next 689 0 R
>>
